note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note otfrag: fixed-text emitter. Concatenate AFTER the tool file that
note defines `text otfr` (a text must be declared before it is read).
note Append fragment number fi of otfr; fragments are separated by byte
note 124 (|) and fragment 0 starts at offset 0.
fn otpfr fi ulong to void
p = ulong 0
c = ulong 0
while lt c fi bound 4096
if eq get otfr p 124
c = add c 1
end
p = add p 1
end
while lt p len otfr bound 4096
b = get otfr p
if eq b 124
ret
end
otpb b
p = add p 1
end
end
